-load i18n

.flex.flex-col.p-12
  .page-title
    -trans "Flows"

  .mt-4
    -blocktrans trimmed
      Flows let you easily ask questions to a group of users. When you send people through a flow over SMS, it feels
      just like any other conversation.

  .mt-2
    -blocktrans trimmed with brand.name as brand
      A flow allows you to map out complex interactions by simply drawing a flowchart. With {{ brand }}'s
      drag-and-drop interface, you can easily build branches based on how people respond to your messages. This makes
      it easy to create personal, engaging experiences for your users.
